# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git via the "*.local" rule) and restart `npm run dev`.
#
# Optional GitHub personal access token. Without it the public API allows
# 60 requests per hour per IP; with it, 5,000. A full resume build uses up to 13.
#
# Create a fine-grained token with NO permissions (public read-only is enough):
#   https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
#
# WARNING: every VITE_* variable is embedded in the client bundle that browsers
# download. Use this for local development only. Never commit a real token and
# never deploy a build that contains one.
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=
